  "releaseNotes": "41cad5a feat(aspnet): wrap email sending errors in a specific exception.\n6579156 feat(auth)!: replace generic user notifier with recipient contract\n3d36e13 feat(invitations): update to retrieve user details from DB\nb9dacac feat(invitations): add method to find recent logins\n92bc1c5 feat(invitations): implement ListAsync\n6f15aab feat(invitations): add stub and tests for ListAsync\nee3ef29 feat(efcore): accept an existing code when creating an invitation\n7b1e258 fix(logging): log user IDs where possible\n3a28333 feat(registration): expire test invitations in 15 mins by default\n54bdde4 feat(registration): change check invitation endpoint to use PUT\n88faf55 feat(registration): separate invitation creation for tests into its own API method\n2dc196e feat(registration)!: make all IInvitationService.CreateAsync parameters optional\n1891964 fix(aspnet): handle missing roles\n9b1d414 feat(registration): add invitation status validation endpoint\nba7e8a8 refactor(aspnet): divide nuxtauthcontrollerbase into smaller partial files\n9a4cbc7 feat(registration): implement invitation signup with role/claim assignment\n2e5327e feat(registration)!: add invitation service to controller and fix notifier fan-out\na07f9bd feat(registration): add EfInvitationService and invitation entity configuration\n6019ddb feat(registration): add invitation models and IInvitationService interface",
